`,imba:!0},id:2895}),e[2896]=t({parent:e[2857],name:"-webkit-grabbing",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates that something is being grabbed.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2896}),e[2897]=t({parent:e[2857],name:"-webkit-zoom-in",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates that something can be zoomed (magnified) in.</p>
