`,aliases:["ml"]},id:2902}),e[2903]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"margin-y",flags:4,mods:32768,cat:2,meta:{alias:"my",desc:`<p>Shorthand property to set values the thickness of the top margin and bottom margin.</p>
`,aliases:["my"]},id:2903}),e[2904]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"margin-x",flags:4,mods:32768,cat:2,meta:{alias:"mx",desc:`<p>Shorthand property to set values the thickness of the left margin and right margin.</p>
`,aliases:["mx"]},id:2904}),e[2905]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"border-radius",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{alias:"rd",desc:`<p>Defines the radii of the outer border edge.</p>
