`,imba:!0},id:2942}),e[2943]=t({parent:e[2940],name:"min-content",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Use the min-content inline size or min-content block size, as appropriate to the writing mode.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2943}),e[2944]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"transform",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>A two-dimensional transformation is applied to an element through the &#39;transform&#39; property. This property contains a list of transform functions similar to those allowed by SVG.</p>
`},id:2944}),e[2945]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"matrix",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 2D transformation in the form of a transformation matrix of six values. matrix(a,b,c,d,e,f) is equivalent to applying the transformation matrix [a b c d e f]</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2945}),e[2946]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"matrix3d",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 3D transformation as a 4x4 homogeneous matrix of 16 values in column-major order.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2946}),e[2947]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"perspective",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a perspective projection matrix.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2947}),e[2948]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"rotate",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 2D rotation by the angle specified in the parameter about the origin of the element, as defined by the transform-origin property.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2948}),e[2949]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"rotate3d",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a clockwise 3D rotation by the angle specified in last parameter about the [x,y,z] direction vector described by the first 3 parameters.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2949}),e[2950]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"scale",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 2D scale operation by the [sx,sy] scaling vector described by the 2 parameters. If the second parameter is not provided, it is takes a value equal to the first.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2950}),e[2951]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"scale3d",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 3D scale operation by the [sx,sy,sz] scaling vector described by the 3 parameters.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2951}),e[2952]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"scaleX",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a scale operation using the [sx,1] scaling vector, where sx is given as the parameter.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2952}),e[2953]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"scaleY",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a scale operation using the [sy,1] scaling vector, where sy is given as the parameter.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2953}),e[2954]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"scaleZ",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a scale operation using the [1,1,sz] scaling vector, where sz is given as the parameter.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2954}),e[2955]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"skew",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a skew transformation along the X and Y axes. The first angle parameter specifies the skew on the X axis. The second angle parameter specifies the skew on the Y axis. If the second parameter is not given then a value of 0 is used for the Y angle (ie: no skew on the Y axis).</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2955}),e[2956]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"skewX",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a skew transformation along the X axis by the given angle.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2956}),e[2957]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"skewY",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a skew transformation along the Y axis by the given angle.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2957}),e[2958]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"translate",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 2D translation by the vector [tx, ty], where tx is the first translation-value parameter and ty is the optional second translation-value parameter.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2958}),e[2959]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"translate3d",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a 3D translation by the vector [tx,ty,tz], with tx, ty and tz being the first, second and third translation-value parameters respectively.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2959}),e[2960]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"translateX",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a translation by the given amount in the X direction.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2960}),e[2961]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"translateY",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a translation by the given amount in the Y direction.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2961}),e[2962]=t({parent:e[2944],name:"translateZ",flags:8192,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies a translation by the given amount in the Z direction. Note that percentage values are not allowed in the translateZ translation-value, and if present are evaluated as 0.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:2962}),e[2963]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"border-bottom",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{alias:"bdb",desc:`<p>Shorthand property for setting border width, style and color.</p>
