`,imba:!0},id:3368}),e[3369]=t({parent:e[3367],name:"alternate-reverse",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The animation cycle iterations that are odd counts are played in the reverse direction, and the animation cycle iterations that are even counts are played in a normal direction.</p>
