`,imba:!0},id:3377}),e[3378]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"perspective",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Applies the same transform as the perspective(<number>) transform function, except that it applies only to the positioned or transformed children of the element, not to the transform on the element itself.</p>
`},id:3378}),e[3379]=t({parent:e[3378],name:"none",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>No perspective transform is applied.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3379}),e[3380]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"grid-template-columns",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{alias:"gtc",desc:`<p>specifies, as a space-separated track list, the line names and track sizing functions of the grid.</p>
`,aliases:["gtc"]},id:3380}),e[3381]=t({parent:e[3380],name:"none",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>There is no explicit grid; any rows/columns will be implicitly generated.</p>
