`,imba:!0},id:3430}),e[3431]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"quotes",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies quotation marks for any number of embedded quotations.</p>
`},id:3431}),e[3432]=t({parent:e[3431],name:"none",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The &#39;open-quote&#39; and &#39;close-quote&#39; values of the &#39;content&#39; property produce no quotations marks, as if they were &#39;no-open-quote&#39; and &#39;no-close-quote&#39; respectively.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3432}),e[3433]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"background-position-y",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>If background images have been specified, this property specifies their initial position (after any resizing) within their corresponding background positioning area.</p>
`},id:3433}),e[3434]=t({parent:e[3433],name:"bottom",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Equivalent to &#39;100%&#39; for the vertical position if one or two values are given, otherwise specifies the bottom edge as the origin for the next offset.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3434}),e[3435]=t({parent:e[3433],name:"center",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Equivalent to &#39;50%&#39; (&#39;left 50%&#39;) for the horizontal position if the horizontal position is not otherwise specified, or &#39;50%&#39; (&#39;top 50%&#39;) for the vertical position if it is.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3435}),e[3436]=t({parent:e[3433],name:"top",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Equivalent to &#39;0%&#39; for the vertical position if one or two values are given, otherwise specifies the top edge as the origin for the next offset.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3436}),e[3437]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"font-stretch",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Selects a normal, condensed, or expanded face from a font family.</p>
`},id:3437}),e[3438]=t({parent:e[3437],name:"narrower",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates a narrower value relative to the width of the parent element.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3438}),e[3439]=t({parent:e[3437],name:"wider",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates a wider value relative to the width of the parent element.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3439}),e[3440]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"stroke-linecap",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Specifies the shape to be used at the end of open subpaths when they are stroked.</p>
`},id:3440}),e[3441]=t({parent:e[3440],name:"butt",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates that the stroke for each subpath does not extend beyond its two endpoints.</p>
