`,imba:!0},id:3442}),e[3443]=t({parent:e[3440],name:"square",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Indicates that at the end of each subpath, the shape representing the stroke will be extended by a rectangle with the same width as the stroke width and whose length is half of the stroke width.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3443}),e[3444]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"object-position",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Determines the alignment of the replaced element inside its box.</p>
