`},id:3515}),e[3516]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"margin-inline-end",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Logical &#39;margin-right&#39;. Mapping depends on the parent element’s &#39;writing-mode&#39;, &#39;direction&#39;, and &#39;text-orientation&#39;.</p>
