`,imba:!0},id:3559}),e[3560]=t({parent:e[3557],name:"space",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The image is tiled (repeated) to fill the area. If it does not fill the area with a whole number of tiles, the extra space is distributed around the tiles.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3560}),e[3561]=t({parent:e[3557],name:"stretch",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The image is stretched to fill the area.</p>
