`,imba:!0},id:3577}),e[3578]=t({parent:e[3576],name:"loose",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Breaks text using the least restrictive set of line-breaking rules. Typically used for short lines, such as in newspapers.</p>
`,imba:!0},id:3578}),e[3579]=t({parent:e[3576],name:"normal",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>Breaks text using the most common set of line-breaking rules.</p>
