`,imba:!0},id:3589}),e[3590]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"grid-area",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{alias:"ga",desc:`<p>Determine a grid item’s size and location within the grid by contributing a line, a span, or nothing (automatic) to its grid placement. Shorthand for &#39;grid-row-start&#39;, &#39;grid-column-start&#39;, &#39;grid-row-end&#39;, and &#39;grid-column-end&#39;.</p>
`,aliases:["ga"]},id:3590}),e[3591]=t({parent:e[3590],name:"auto",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The property contributes nothing to the grid item’s placement, indicating auto-placement, an automatic span, or a default span of one.</p>
