`},id:3743}),e[3744]=t({parent:e[3743],name:"auto",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>The user agent may use any algorithm to determine the underline’s position. In horizontal line layout, the underline should be aligned as for alphabetic. In vertical line layout, if the language is set to Japanese or Korean, the underline should be aligned as for over.</p>
