`},id:3791}),e[3792]=t({parent:e[3791],name:"flip",flags:8,mods:0,cat:32,meta:{desc:`<p>After rotating by the precededing angle, the image is flipped horizontally. Defaults to 0deg if the angle is ommitted.</p>
