`},id:3811}),e[3812]=t({parent:e[2353],name:"paint-order",flags:4,mods:0,cat:2,meta:{desc:`<p>Controls the order that the three paint operations that shapes and text are rendered with: their fill, their stroke and any markers they might have.</p>
